# Zack Fair: "Put Zack Fair's counters on that creature" - all of them, not just the +1/+1 counter (the ruling). Bot2's Floodpits Drowner, flashed in on Bot1's turn 3 after his untap step, puts a
# stun counter on him, so he has a +1/+1 counter and a stun counter; sacrificed for the Ornithopter, which gets both (a 1/3 Ornithopter holding a stun counter,
# CR 122.1d).

